{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 28,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked flee when no man pursueth;\nBut the righteous are bold as a lion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the transgression of a land many are the princes thereof;\nBut by men of understanding ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " knowledge the state ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thereof",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be prolonged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A needy man that oppresseth the poor\nIs ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a sweeping rain which leaveth no food.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that forsake the law praise the wicked;\nBut such as keep the law contend with them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Evil men understand not justice;\nBut they that seek Jehovah understand all things.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Better is the poor that walketh in his integrity,\nThan he that is perverse in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ways, though he be rich.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoso keepeth the law is a wise son;\nBut he that is a companion of gluttons shameth his father.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that augmenteth his substance by interest and increase,\nGathereth it for him that hath pity on the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that turneth away his ear from hearing the law,\nEven his prayer is an abomination.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoso causeth the upright to go astray in an evil way,\nHe shall fall himself into his own pit;\nBut the perfect shall inherit good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The rich man is wise in his own conceit;\nBut the poor that hath understanding searcheth him out.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the righteous triumph, there is great glory;\nBut when the wicked rise, men hide themselves.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that covereth his transgressions shall not prosper;\nBut whoso confesseth and forsaketh them shall obtain mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Happy is the man that feareth alway;\nBut he that hardeneth his heart shall fall into mischief.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a roaring lion, and a ranging bear,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "So is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a wicked ruler over a poor people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The prince that lacketh understanding is also a great oppressor;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that hateth covetousness shall prolong his days.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man that is laden with the blood of any person\nShall flee unto the pit; let no man stay him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoso walketh uprightly shall be delivered;\nBut he that is perverse in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ways shall fall at once.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that tilleth his land shall have plenty of bread;\nBut he that followeth after vain ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "persons",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall have poverty enough.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A faithful man shall abound with blessings;\nBut he that maketh haste to be rich shall not be unpunished.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To have respect of persons is not good;Neither that a man should transgress for a piece of bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hath an evil eye hasteth after riches,\nAnd knoweth not that want shall come upon him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that rebuketh a man shall afterward find more favor\nThan he that flattereth with the tongue.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoso robbeth his father or his mother, and saith, It is no transgression,\nThe same is the companion of a destroyer.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is of a greedy spirit stirreth up strife;\nBut he that putteth his trust in Jehovah shall be made fat.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that trusteth in his own heart is a fool;\nBut whoso walketh wisely, he shall be delivered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that giveth unto the poor shall not lack;\nBut he that hideth his eyes shall have many a curse.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.28.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the wicked rise, men hide themselves;\nBut when they perish, the righteous increase.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
